{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of music in <i>Melodic Mage</i>, a 2D pixel art action shooter where every attack and dodge must follow the rhythm! Play as a wizard battling through dynamic levels, casting spells, dashing, and dodging\u2014<i>all in sync with the beat</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Cast spells and dodge enemy attacks in sync with the music.<br>\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Magical Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Unlock and choose between different mages.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> \u2013 Conquer diverse levels, each with their own final boss.<br>\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Hard mode\u00a0</strong>\u2013 For those looking for a challenge, the hard mode will punish you every time you miss a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm. Control the magic. <i>Become the Melodic Mage!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"POWER SHOT!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/8d679eda93e14cd1c10fd365d3c3bc1eee084ff1.jpg"},{"name":"DUNGEON DONE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/e332c2568163c14a06ec8d92e8220e550c02e227.jpg"},{"name":"FURNACE FINISHED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/7c96b0c3d5a646e6244b1cf227ecc049abb19693.jpg"},{"name":"GLACIER GONE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/697b1347b221daae1bf25e16f9a1b44de83edb66.jpg"},{"name":"CAVERN COMPLETED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/2d0ad3921c4b0d9dd6957bc6bbbed236c56943e3.jpg"},{"name":"CHAOS CONQUERED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3515490/d3a03320a6f3b7ca4545886e6af261d9fdfaaa9f.jpg"},{"name":"ENDLESS